      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to ${(4wz)}^{2}?$",
      "worked_solution": "We apply the power of product rule and then simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(4wz)}^{2} & = \\\\ {4}^{2}{w}^{2}{z}^{2} & = \\\\ 16{w}^{2}{z}^{2} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
